  /// OpenCL BACKWARD helper for TNNetPixelShuffle (space-to-depth scatter). The
  // forward shuffle is a bijection (a pure permutation), so the backward
  // gradient scatter is collision-free: each source element receives exactly
  // one output gradient. REUSES the SAME source-index buffer the forward built
  // (output element -> source linear offset) and writes the OTHER direction.
  // Binds the cai_pixel_shuffle_scatter entry point on the shared dot-product
  // program's device. One work-item per output element. Backward-only.
  // Coded by Claude (AI).
