  /// Unified spatial resize to an ABSOLUTE target (W,H), a port of PyTorch's
  // nn.functional.interpolate(size=(H,W), mode=..., align_corners=...). Unlike the
  // integer-factor up-samplers (TNNetBilinearUpsample / TNNetBicubicUpsample) this
  // resamples to an ARBITRARY output grid (up- OR down-sample, non-integer ratios)
  // and supports THREE modes selected at construction time:
