  //                    except to the single picked source pixel).
  //   rmBilinear (1) : separable linear, the 4-corner blend reusing the same
  //                    bilinear corner geometry as TNNetBilinearResize.
  //   rmBicubic  (2) : separable Keys cubic-convolution (A=-0.75, PyTorch bicubic),
  //                    reusing the shared CubicWeights kernel and the 4x4 clamped
  //                    edge-replicate neighbourhood of TNNetBicubicUpsample.
